---
const bookingUrl = 'https://calendly.com/cartertwitty/30min';
---
<section class="final-cta" id="apply">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Next Step</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">
      If this resonates,<br />let's talk.
    </h2>
    <p class="lede">
      The first step is a short conversation — honest, no pitch. Just to see if we're the right
      fit and if I can actually help with what you're dealing with.
    </p>
    <a href={bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
      Apply for a Discovery Call <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>
    <p class="note">Application takes 2 minutes · no cost to apply</p>

    <div class="container-stats">
      <div>
        <span class="cta-stat-value">9 weeks</span>
        <span class="cta-stat-label">Full Commitment</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="cta-stat-value">1:1</span>
        <span class="cta-stat-label">Mentorship Only</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="cta-stat-value">Honest</span>
        <span class="cta-stat-label">Conversation First</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
